    <string name="tos_section_1_title">1. General rules</string>
    <string name="tos_section_1_body">The kidZone application is used to share information about kid-friendly places. By using it, you agree to comply with these Terms of Service.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_2_title">2. Account</string>
    <string name="tos_section_2_body">Each user can have one account. You are responsible for the security of your login data. You can delete your account at any time in the Profile, in the Account and Security section. A public account deletion manual is available at https://playground-705e7162.web.app/account-deletion.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_title">3. Rules of conduct</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_intro">You agree to:</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_1">Publishing true information about places</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_2">Expressing opinions culturally and substantively</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_3">Respecting other users</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_4">Not publishing offensive content, spam or advertisements</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_5">Not adding inappropriate photos</string>
    <string name="tos_section_3_bullet_6">Not manipulating rankings and badges</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_title">4. Account block</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_body">Violation of the Terms of Service may result in account block. The block can be temporary (for a certain number of days) or irreversible (permanent). A blocked user cannot log in to the application. You will be informed of the block by email with the reason.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_intro">A block may occur in particular for:</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_bullet_1">Adding false information</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_bullet_2">Publishing offensive content or spam</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_bullet_3">Harassing other users</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_bullet_4">Adding inappropriate photos</string>
    <string name="tos_section_4_bullet_5">Creating multiple accounts to bypass the block</string>
    <string name="tos_section_5_title">5. Content removal</string>
    <string name="tos_section_5_body">The administrator may remove a place, review or photo that violates the Terms of Service. You will be informed of the removal by email with the reason.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_6_title">6. User content</string>
    <string name="tos_section_6_body">By adding content, you declare that you have the right to publish it. After deleting your account, your reviews will be anonymized, and the added places may remain visible if they do not contain personal data and are part of the public database of places.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_7_title">7. Photos of children and third parties</string>
    <string name="tos_section_7_body">Do not publish photos of children or third parties without all required consents. Photos violating the privacy, image or safety of a child may be removed after report.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_8_title">8. Liability</string>
    <string name="tos_section_8_body">kidZone is not responsible for content published by users and does not guarantee its timeliness.</string>
    <string name="tos_section_9_title">9. Changes to Terms</string>
    <string name="tos_section_9_body">You will be informed of significant changes to the Terms of Service in the application or by email. Continued use of the application means acceptance of the new terms.</string>
